      "writtenOn": "2023-04-20T20:43:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that updating the shared `struct fan_data` is not worth it for this  temporary code.\n\nI suggest using Zephyr\u0027s timer functionality instead of simple counter.\n\n```\nK_TIMER_DEFINE(grace_period_timer, 0, 0);\n...\n\nif (k_timer_remaining_get(\u0026grace_period_timer) !\u003d 0)\n    /* timer is running */\n    if (k_timer_status_get(\u0026grace_period_timer) \u003d\u003d 0)\n       /* timer has not yet expired */\n       return FAN_STATUS_FRUSTRATED;\n       \nk_timer_stop(\u0026grace_period_timer);\n\n...\nif (ABS(rpm_diff) \u003e\u003d 2500) {\n    k_timer_start(\u0026grace_period_timer, K_MSEC(1000), K_NO_WAIT);\n...\n} else if (ABS(rpm_diff) \u003e\u003d 250) {\n    k_timer_start(\u0026grace_period_timer, K_MSEC(750), K_NO_WAIT);\n    \n```",
      "parentUuid": "9d11bc69_f6f14ef9",
      "revId": "f801fdb0eff86c769ef817bccd932bb8fbb25498",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
