      "writtenOn": "2023-04-21T11:39:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done\n\nWhy do we need to call `k_timer_status_get`?\nAfter taking a quick look I think `k_timer_remaining_ticks` should provide enough information.\nPlease take a look at the new approach.",
      "parentUuid": "997680dd_793544fe",
