      "writtenOn": "2023-04-21T15:52:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to the header: https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/include/zephyr/kernel.h.\n\n```\n * This routine stops a running timer prematurely. The timer\u0027s stop function,\n * if one exists, is invoked by the caller.\n *\n * Attempting to stop a timer that is not running is permitted, but has no\n * effect on the timer.\n```\n\nAs long as the timer is running the condition in line 233 will be satisfied and we\u0027ll leave the function early.\nBecause of that and the comment above I don\u0027t think we need to call this function.",
      "parentUuid": "f5b42784_38b498c7",
      "revId": "f801fdb0eff86c769ef817bccd932bb8fbb25498",
